{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_11","type":"agent_message","text":"Clone probes identify color 9 as the avatar. Actions 3 and 4 move it sideways, and coordinate clicks remove yellow tiles. Rising also scrolls the board. The existing shaft leg reaches a terminal state without completing level 2; I’ll trace that failure before deciding what can be reused."}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_12","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"python - <<'PY'\np='probe_level2.py';s=open(p).read().replace(\\\"A.run_program('bp35',run)\\\",\\\"if __name__=='__main__': A.run_program('bp35',run)\\\");open(p,'w').write(s)\np='probe_routes.py';s=open(p).read().replace(\\\"A.run_program('bp35',run)\\\",\\\"if __name__=='__main__': A.run_program('bp35',run)\\\");open(p,'w').write(s)\nPY\ncat > probe_trace.py <<'PY'\nfrom probe_routes import *\nclass Trace:\n def __init__(self,e):self.e=e;self.n=0\n def __getattr__(self,k):return getattr(self.e,k)\n def step(self,*a):\n  self.e.step(*a);self.n+=1\n  print(self.n,a,brief(self.e),flush=True)\ndef run(e):\n for a in json.load(open('checkpoint.json'))['final_path']:safe_step(e,a)\n ascend_breakable_shaft(Trace(e.clone()))\nA.run_program('bp35',run)\nPY\npython probe_trace.py\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
